        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          61 He Gaychamv dinhmei nang",
            "                  12.13.12. 10.Ref. 10.10.10.8",
            "",
            "          1. He Gaychamv dinc bammei nang tabui thangc bam cho!",
            "             Nang latkaeng chu niimei, meic aching ching rui khwan bam.",
            "             Howna how makmei nunc, chuna chu makmei guay,",
            "             Nang tik nang hym how niimei rui khwan bam.",
            "",
            "                     Luangh rui heicdi 'kauhbam sihnic tat ni",
            "                     Paubauhmei latdanv piu mak ngammak ge",
            "                     Nzianloumei pow tei ai phungc bam e",
            "                     Poubauhmei siamruai ai sw ni.",
            "",
            "          2. Seitaanc baanc khou zinghmei bamv khou bammei guay ta",
            "             Kalvari riw ta howmakna bammei nai e",
            "             Maikwam chaeng khou gut khang 'thiam bame Seitaan rui",
            "             Gaychamv tei dinclou o kaniw khoutei",
            "",
            "          3. Gaychamv khawn tei chu nii makmei maansei guay mu",
            "             Tingsaeng zaeng ryanraa kappui mei sw bam pwni",
            "             Khoutei lunghlaihmei guloumei nai dat lak khe",
            "             Tingsaeng zaeng ryanraa akhaengv bam pwni.",
            "",
            "          4. He Gaychamv rui kaw e chulou o rupryan guay,",
            "             Gaychamv tuang guangtangc nimei ganv guang the, 'naa the",
            "             Lwmloumei guayna rui tingkauh thangc tat pwni",
            "             Zaengthaekc ni the, Hallelujah, Amen."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
